{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XDCQtHDGw5fm87WtBisqq2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Contributing\n2\t\n3\t## Dev setup\n4\t\n5\t- Go 1.27+\n6\t- `golangci-lint` v2 (`go install github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2/cmd/golangci-lint@latest`)\n7\t\n8\t## Before every commit\n9\t\n10\t```sh\n11\tgo vet ./... && go test -race ./... && golangci-lint run\n12\t```\n13\t\n14\t## Rules\n15\t\n16\t- Every external system (tracker, git host, executor, model) sits behind an interface in `internal/` with a fake. Unit tests never touch the network.\n17\t- Design decisions go in `docs/decisions.md` with the alternative rejected. If you change a decision, add a new entry that supersedes the old one; do not edit history.\n18\t- Tests first. A task is not done until `go test -race ./...` passes.\n19\t- Conventional commit messages: `feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`.\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2daaed25-284e-4780-838f-5b169e1711d5","uuid":"e159298a-fdee-4ccf-92ed-24e606970ede","timestamp":"2026-09-20T02:11:56.431Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/thomas/.local/share/hivedispatch/repos/thomasmeadows__HiveDispatch/SCRUM-5/CONTRIBUTING.md","content":"# Contributing\n\n## Dev setup\n\n- Go 1.27+\n- `golangci-lint` v2 (`go install github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2/cmd/golangci-lint@latest`)\n\n## Before every commit\n\n```sh\ngo vet ./... && go test -race ./... && golangci-lint run\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- Every external system (tracker, git host, executor, model) sits behind an interface in `internal/` with a fake. Unit tests never touch the network.\n- Design decisions go in `docs/decisions.md` with the alternative rejected. If you change a decision, add a new entry that supersedes the old one; do not edit history.\n- Tests first. A task is not done until `go test -race ./...` passes.\n- Conventional commit messages: `feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`.\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
