s not done until `go test -race ./...` passes.\n- Conventional commit messages: `feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":6,"newStart":5,"newLines":17,"lines":[" - Go 1.27+"," - `golangci-lint` v2 (`go install github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2/cmd/golangci-lint@latest`)"," ","+## Build and test locally","+","+```sh","+go build ./...                    # compile every package","+go build -o hivedispatch ./cmd/hivedispatch && ./hivedispatch -h   # build and run the CLI","+go test -race ./...               # run all tests with the race detector","+go test -race -run TestName ./internal/pkg   # one test in one package","+```","+","+Unit tests are hermetic: every external system has a fake under `internal/`, so no credentials or network are needed to run the suite.","+"," ## Before every commit"," "," ```sh"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
